{"event_type":"review","id":"754d1dac434dc997a02da2ad0aa0fef208535d79f258da59359c343880a52bbd","occurred_at":"2026-11-14T12:43:10Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/eb70158d2491f10f0354b80dfada085a656b836f91cfa9262630be0432d64f93","sha256":"eb70158d2491f10f0354b80dfada085a656b836f91cfa9262630be0432d64f93"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/77b5d8f5e4fcf486bf509b05ff13850d10a45be31d287618a5cdd10802e541c3","sha256":"77b5d8f5e4fcf486bf509b05ff13850d10a45be31d287618a5cdd10802e541c3"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/dad41f27084e6cdb708c233187c81cc5adf2cb23402faefc047497aec6e57a83","sha256":"dad41f27084e6cdb708c233187c81cc5adf2cb23402faefc047497aec6e57a83"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c48569f988af9280bac20fcecf80f37b07934cb20d99c580b28188c084313c33","sha256":"c48569f988af9280bac20fcecf80f37b07934cb20d99c580b28188c084313c33"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d356f6cf49760a4519efe1d265ca89dbc42357e78eb2308f9c7b22006e529276","sha256":"d356f6cf49760a4519efe1d265ca89dbc42357e78eb2308f9c7b22006e529276"}],"attempt_id":"db0f30b84757b1134628f9535168e821495c1730668a04f3d8012a4ed37a87c7:0:1","base":"e4e25d582b9a7df24e408c39d373f1d169bcd05f","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"9575574e039dbc5a6f48a13d1549d97bc7df4d1b","body":"**Recovery can refuse a valid retained snapshot when the advanced commit cannot render the unit.**\n\n`UNIT-LIVE-BINDING.md:30-34` states that a checkout `HEAD` advance changes only the composed selection. It also states that the composed render is not consumed by recovery. The code does not match this. `deploy-controller.py:1503-1507` calls `adapter_factory` before `validate_snapshot`, with no exception handling around the call. `production_adapter` passes the current `HEAD` as `source_sha`, and `unit-switch-factory.py:282-283` renders the prior unit at that commit. If the advanced commit lacks `apps/crq-python/ops/systemd/<unit>` (`prepare-host.py:586`), or its template fails validation (`prepare-host.py:593`), or it no longer has exactly one `ExecStart=` line (`prepare-host.py:594`), the render raises. Recovery then stops before `restore`, so the retained snapshot is not restored.\n\nThe remedy requires a design decision. Recovery could compose without rendering the current `HEAD`, or the documentation could declare a commit without a valid prior unit template outside the allowed recovery states. The inspected source does not establish which option is safe, so this comment does not propose a patch.","id":"50d0cb61f20c758f173455920b09f7dfacb8ad127038c8156366b3b5291b94b8","intervals":[[282,283]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-switch-factory.py","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Recovery can refuse a valid retained snapshot when the advanced commit cannot render the unit."}],"head":"f9cfb05ae1becf9f81955fd4eb631854c39e5caa","head_tree":"ff441c47f135816927d2c105b0555b66502df3d8","input_scope":[{"blob":"6d80f1b5bfb5e337cc6b652ef3f224053dffa891","intervals":[[1,158]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/UNIT-LIVE-BINDING.md"},{"blob":"9575574e039dbc5a6f48a13d1549d97bc7df4d1b","intervals":[[1,287]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-switch-factory.py"}],"job_id":"db0f30b84757b1134628f9535168e821495c1730668a04f3d8012a4ed37a87c7:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"6d80f1b5bfb5e337cc6b652ef3f224053dffa891","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/ops/UNIT-LIVE-BINDING.md","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"9575574e039dbc5a6f48a13d1549d97bc7df4d1b","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-switch-factory.py","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"6d80f1b5bfb5e337cc6b652ef3f224053dffa891","intervals":[[92,108],[114,116]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/UNIT-LIVE-BINDING.md"},{"blob":"9575574e039dbc5a6f48a13d1549d97bc7df4d1b","intervals":[[203,207],[213,214]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-switch-factory.py"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"6d80f1b5bfb5e337cc6b652ef3f224053dffa891","intervals":[[92,108],[114,116]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/UNIT-LIVE-BINDING.md"},{"blob":"9575574e039dbc5a6f48a13d1549d97bc7df4d1b","intervals":[[203,207],[213,214]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-switch-factory.py"}],"scope_digest":"2883d99300dc1341c8909b7cea965ed009e82391959f7cf42c4b240e3c182829","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-db0f30b84757b1134628f9535168e821495c1730668a04f3d8012a4ed37a87c7-g0-20261114T123918Z","producer":"crq-runner-app","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","type":"crq-run"},"subject_id":"db0f30b84757b1134628f9535168e821495c1730668a04f3d8012a4ed37a87c7","target":"14bc5a877029a63a2284263a5e98850bc967551c","target_tree":"ff441c47f135816927d2c105b0555b66502df3d8"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit:crq-runner-app:backfill-db0f30b84757b1134628f9535168e821495c1730668a04f3d8012a4ed37a87c7-g0-20261114T123918Z"}